      "message": "Could you try if the following also solves the issue? I guess the result of `get_resample_evt()` is the right event to wait. `signal_used_queue(vector)` and `interrupt_resample()` will do the same thing for non-msi-x device, but `interrupt_resample()` would be the right one from the semantics\u0027 perspective. \n```\ninterrupt_clone.get_resample_evt().wait();\ninterrupt_clone.interrupt_resample();\n```\nBut I\u0027m not so sure, please correct me if I\u0027m wrong @dverkamp@chromium.org",
